{"title": "Legacy of Cania: Flame Blade", "pageid": 58419, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Legacy_of_Cania:_Flame_Blade", "categories": ["Spells", "Level 2 Spells", "Evocation spells", "Bonus actions", "Item summoning actions", "Light Emitting"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">This article is about the Mephistopheles tiefling variant of the spell. For the normal spell, see <a href=\"/wiki/Flame_Blade\" title=\"Flame Blade\">Flame Blade</a>. For the weapon, see <a href=\"/wiki/Flame_Blade_(weapon)\" title=\"Flame Blade (weapon)\">Flame Blade (weapon)</a>.  </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Flame_Blade.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/Flame_Blade.webp/300px-Flame_Blade.webp, /w/images/8/8a/Flame_Blade.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/Flame_Blade.webp/300px-Flame_Blade.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8a/Flame_Blade.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Legacy of Cania: Flame Blade </b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">level 2 evocation spell</a>. It is an racial spell variant of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flame_Blade\" title=\"Flame Blade\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Flame_Blade_Icon.webp/20px-Flame_Blade_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Flame_Blade_Icon.webp/30px-Flame_Blade_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Flame_Blade_Icon.webp/40px-Flame_Blade_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Flame Blade\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Flame_Blade_Icon.webp/20px-Flame_Blade_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Flame_Blade_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Flame_Blade\" title=\"Flame Blade\">Flame Blade</a> that allows <a href=\"/wiki/Mephistopheles_tiefling\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mephistopheles tiefling\">Mephistopheles tieflings</a> to summon a temporary flaming blade once per rest.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Conjure a flaming <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flame_Blade_(weapon)\" title=\"Flame Blade (weapon)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/61/Flame_Blade_Weapon_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Flame_Blade_Weapon_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/61/Flame_Blade_Weapon_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Flame_Blade_Weapon_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/61/Flame_Blade_Weapon_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Flame_Blade_Weapon_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/61/Flame_Blade_Weapon_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Flame_Blade_Weapon_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/61/Flame_Blade_Weapon_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Flame_Blade_(weapon)\" title=\"Flame Blade (weapon)\">Scimitar</a> in your hand for 10 turns that deals <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">3d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> damage. It sheds a bright light in a 3 m (10 ft) radius and a dim light in a 6 m (20 ft) radius. \n</p>\nThe blade can be unequipped and equipped again, but must stay on the spellcaster's person.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/28px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/42px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/28px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: Self\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: Self</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Long rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 10  turns</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"At_higher_levels\"> At higher levels </span></h2>\n<p>Casting this spell at a higher level grants no additional benefit. </p>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_FlameBlade_MephistophelesTiefling</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_FlameBlade_MephistophelesTiefling\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_FlameBlade_MephistophelesTiefling\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/HasSomaticComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasSomaticComponent (spell flag)\">HasSomaticComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasVerbalComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasVerbalComponent (spell flag)\">HasVerbalComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsSpell_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsSpell (spell flag)\">IsSpell</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=NoCooldownOnMiss_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"NoCooldownOnMiss (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">NoCooldownOnMiss</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span id=\"Item:_Flame_Blade_.28weapon.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Item:_Flame_Blade_(weapon)\"> Item: Flame Blade (weapon) </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"nomobile\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Flame_Blade_Weapon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Flame_Blade_Weapon.png/180px-Flame_Blade_Weapon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Flame_Blade_Weapon.png/270px-Flame_Blade_Weapon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Flame_Blade_Weapon.png/360px-Flame_Blade_Weapon.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Flame_Blade_Weapon.png/180px-Flame_Blade_Weapon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"180\" height=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4c/Flame_Blade_Weapon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure></div>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flame_Blade_(weapon)\" title=\"Flame Blade (weapon)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/61/Flame_Blade_Weapon_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Flame_Blade_Weapon_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/61/Flame_Blade_Weapon_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Flame_Blade_Weapon_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/6/61/Flame_Blade_Weapon_Unfaded_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/61/Flame_Blade_Weapon_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Flame_Blade_Weapon_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/61/Flame_Blade_Weapon_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Flame_Blade_(weapon)\" title=\"Flame Blade (weapon)\">Flame Blade</a></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;– <span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 10  turns\n</p>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-left: 20px\">\n    <dt>Damage: 3~18</dt><dd class=\"bg3wiki-damage-display\" style=\"margin-left:0px\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;width:fit-content\"><span style=\"display:block;position:relative;width:30px;height:30px;margin-left:0px;padding-top:0px;margin-right:2px\"><span style=\"z-index:0;position:absolute;transform:translate( 0%, 0%)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/96/D6_Fire.png/27px-D6_Fire.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/96/D6_Fire.png/40px-D6_Fire.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/96/D6_Fire.png/54px-D6_Fire.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/96/D6_Fire.png/27px-D6_Fire.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/9/96/D6_Fire.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><div><div style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">3d6</span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a></div></div></div></dd>\n  </div>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-left: 20px\">\n<b>Properties</b><div class=\"bg3wiki-horizontlist\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scimitars\" title=\"Scimitars\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/be/Scimitars_Icon.png/25px-Scimitars_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/be/Scimitars_Icon.png/38px-Scimitars_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/be/Scimitars_Icon.png/50px-Scimitars_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Scimitars\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/be/Scimitars_Icon.png/25px-Scimitars_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/be/Scimitars_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scimitars\" title=\"Scimitars\">Scimitars</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_melee_weapons\" title=\"List of melee weapons\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/25px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/38px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Melee\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/25px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/List_of_melee_weapons\" title=\"List of melee weapons\">Melee</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Martial_weapons\" title=\"Martial weapons\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png/25px-Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/17/Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png/38px-Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/17/Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png/50px-Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Martial\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png/25px-Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/17/Martial_Weapon_Prof_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Martial_weapons\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Martial weapons\">Martial</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Weapons#Weapon_slots\" title=\"Weapons\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Handedness_Icon.png/25px-Handedness_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Handedness_Icon.png/38px-Handedness_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/b/ba/Handedness_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"One-handed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Handedness_Icon.png/25px-Handedness_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Handedness_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Weapons#Weapon_slots\" title=\"Weapons\">One-handed</a></li></ul>\n</div> \n<div class=\"bg3wiki-horizontlist\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 30 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  30           gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)</li></ul>\n</div> \n</div> \n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\nRaces: <ul><li> Character level 5: <a href=\"/wiki/Mephistopheles_Tiefling\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mephistopheles Tiefling\">Mephistopheles Tiefling</a> </li></ul>\n<p>(<i>Character level</i> is the sum of all class levels for a multi-classed character.)\n</p>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Compared with the weapon summoned by the normal <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flame_Blade\" title=\"Flame Blade\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Flame_Blade_Icon.webp/20px-Flame_Blade_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Flame_Blade_Icon.webp/30px-Flame_Blade_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Flame_Blade_Icon.webp/40px-Flame_Blade_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Flame Blade\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Flame_Blade_Icon.webp/20px-Flame_Blade_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Flame_Blade_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Flame_Blade\" title=\"Flame Blade\">Flame Blade</a> spell, attacks with the racial variant count as a melee weapon attacks instead of a melee spell attacks. This means it behaves like an ordinary weapon for all relevant interactions. For example, it benefits from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Synergy_(Condition)\" title=\"Arcane Synergy (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1d/Arcane_Synergy_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Arcane_Synergy_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1d/Arcane_Synergy_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Arcane_Synergy_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1d/Arcane_Synergy_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Arcane_Synergy_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Arcane Synergy\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1d/Arcane_Synergy_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Arcane_Synergy_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1d/Arcane_Synergy_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Synergy_(Condition)\" title=\"Arcane Synergy (Condition)\">Arcane Synergy</a> while normal Flame Blades do not.</li>\n<li>The ability modifier used for the attack roll is always <a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a>, regardless of the caster's class.</li>\n<li>The summoned weapon does not interact with <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gloves_of_Battlemage%27s_Power\" title=\"Gloves of Battlemage's Power\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Gloves_Metal_I_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Gloves_Metal_I_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Gloves_Metal_I_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_Metal_I_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Gloves_Metal_I_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Gloves_Metal_I_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Gloves_Metal_I_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Gloves_Metal_I_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8f/Gloves_Metal_I_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gloves_of_Battlemage%27s_Power\" title=\"Gloves of Battlemage's Power\">Gloves of Battlemage's Power</a> or <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pyroquickness_Hat\" title=\"Pyroquickness Hat\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Pyroquickness_Hat_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Pyroquickness_Hat_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Pyroquickness_Hat_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Pyroquickness_Hat_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Pyroquickness_Hat_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Pyroquickness_Hat_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Pyroquickness_Hat_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Pyroquickness_Hat_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Pyroquickness_Hat_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Pyroquickness_Hat\" title=\"Pyroquickness Hat\">Pyroquickness Hat</a> unlike with the normal spell.</li>\n<li>Other aspects of the weapon are the same as the normal Flame Blade, so refer to the <a href=\"/wiki/Flame_Blade#Notes\" title=\"Flame Blade\">notes</a> of that spell for more details.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715043150\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.124 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.135 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 5912/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 93110/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 39598/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 33/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 35/1000\nLua time usage: 0.047/7.000 second